{"nodes": [{"id": "docker_compose_stack_prod", "label": "Stack de production fitcarnet (Portainer depuis Gitea)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_chemins_absolus", "label": "Chemins absolus sous /volume1/docker/fitcarnet", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Portainer CE ne r\u00e9sout pas les chemins relatifs d'une stack Git (/data/compose/<id>/ invisible du d\u00e9mon Docker) : le code arrive par un vrai clone mis \u00e0 jour par deployer-nas.sh.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_db", "label": "Service fitcarnet-db (postgres:16-alpine)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_base_sans_port_publie", "label": "Pas de port publi\u00e9 pour la base", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La base \u00e9tait publi\u00e9e sur 5433 d'un NAS joignable depuis Internet : aucun contr\u00f4le applicatif \u00e0 franchir, seule barri\u00e8re DB_PASSWORD sans limitation. Administration par docker exec ou tunnel SSH.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_app", "label": "Service fitcarnet-app (FrankenPHP : API Symfony et front)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_pas_d_extra_hosts", "label": "Pas d'extra_hosts vers Grocy : un constat, pas un oubli", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trois raccourcis essay\u00e9s le 12 ao\u00fbt 2026 ; la mesure elle-m\u00eame variait d'un facteur 50 (0,026 s puis 1,301 s) : rien n'a \u00e9t\u00e9 chang\u00e9. \u00c0 reprendre avec dix mesures altern\u00e9es NAS au repos.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_cors_https_seul", "label": "CORS_ALLOW_ORIGIN : HTTPS seul et domaine de production seul (constat F-02)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L107", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le motif acceptait http:// et localhost:5173 (port de Vite, recopi\u00e9 d'ailleurs) ; l'authentification passe par l'en-t\u00eate Authorization, CORS n'est pas la fronti\u00e8re, mais un motif trop large finit recopi\u00e9 l\u00e0 o\u00f9 il compte. $$ pour un $ litt\u00e9ral.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_default_uri", "label": "DEFAULT_URI dans la stack", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L130", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exig\u00e9 sans valeur par d\u00e9faut par routing.yaml : sans elle cache:clear \u00e9choue et le conteneur ne d\u00e9marre jamais ; elle vivait dans api/.env, ignor\u00e9 par git.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_healthcheck_fsockopen", "label": "Sonde de sant\u00e9 de fitcarnet-app par fsockopen (d\u00e9lai 2 s)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L163", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le port qui \u00e9coute prouve que le rituel du point d'entr\u00e9e (composer install, cl\u00e9s JWT, db/manuel/, cache) est fini ; fsockopen car l'image n'a pas curl ; d\u00e9lai explicite sinon default_socket_timeout de 60 s.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_taches", "label": "Service fitcarnet-taches (app:inventaire:traiter --boucle)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L209", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "M\u00eame bloc build que l'app pour r\u00e9utiliser le cache de couches ; pas de ports ni de volumes front/telecharger.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_replicas_2", "label": "Deux travailleurs d'inventaire (replicas: 2)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L218", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un lot Grocy est ~300 fois plus lent qu'un lot base ; un seul lot lent \u00e0 la fois (instance Grocy unique, un compte grocy, index unique partiel) : un travailleur absorbe le lent, l'autre les rapides. R\u00e8gle : autant de travailleurs que de comptes grocy, plus un.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_entrypoint_court_circuite", "label": "Point d'entr\u00e9e court-circuit\u00e9 pour les travailleurs", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L259", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "entrypoint-prod installe, migre et chauffe le cache sur le m\u00eame /app : deux processus en parall\u00e8le risquent une corruption non reproductible.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docker_compose_healthcheck_disable", "label": "Sonde de sant\u00e9 d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e sur fitcarnet-taches", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": "L268", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La sonde h\u00e9rit\u00e9e de FrankenPHP marquait les travailleurs unhealthy en permanence ; un indicateur qui crie toujours ne signale plus rien.", "_origin": "semantic"}], "edges": [{"source": "docker_compose_stack_prod", "target": "docker_compose_chemins_absolus", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docker_compose_stack_prod", "target": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_db", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docker_compose_stack_prod", "target": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_app", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docker_compose_stack_prod", "target": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_taches", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docker_compose_chemins_absolus", "target": "docker_compose_stack_prod", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docker_compose_base_sans_port_publie", "target": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_db", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docker_compose_pas_d_extra_hosts", "target": "docker_compose_fitcarnet_app", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docker-compose.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docker_compose_cors_https_seul", "target": "docker_compose_fitcarnet